@crypto/sha512

#encoding/hex

// SHA-512 aligned with Go `crypto/sha512` (Sum512). Pure i64 integer
// arithmetic in two's-complement wrapping: the u64 lanes of FIPS 180-4
// are carried in i64, rotations are built from arithmetic shifts plus
// explicit masks. Compresses 128-byte windows in place (no full-message
// copy). sum returns the 128-char lowercase hex digest; Digest.write
// 按 128 字节窗口就地压缩（不整份拼接）。

